    "8": {
        "lines": [
            "　　And here, We have the cat Mount.",
            "　　Why the name? because a lot of cats lives in here (duh).",
            "　　This mount is located somewhere around halloween country.",
            "     where beast-cats lives in groups of families."
        ]
    },
    "14": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"...I'm Home.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Finally...After this long ass day.\""
        ]
    },
    "18": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Oh Kidda. There you are.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I've been here laying my ass all day.\""
        ]
    },
    "21": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Well good thing.\""
        ]
    },
    "24": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"Halloween capital has been a complete disaster today...",
        ]
    },
    "27": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Oh weird, Everything has been normal over here.\"",
        ]
    },
    "31": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"I'm surprised.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I guess the cat mount is far enough to not be affected.\""
        ]
    },
    "34": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Or probably it was affected and I didn't realized. I was asleep.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"There was a blood moon right?\""
        ]
    },
    "37": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678\"> \"Yes but no. Let's call it \"Ugly Moon\".",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"It was making people feel drunk and stupid.\".",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"And despite that, it was actually a black hole sucking halloween.\""
        ]
    },
    "40": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"A blood moon acting like a black hole? Woah.\""
        ]
    },
    "43": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"Correct. Two in one.",
            "<c$$12345678\"> The responsible was some idiot in Makai. She wanted to steal holidays.\""
        ]
    },
    "46": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"I would be thinking you smoked something heavy today.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"But I'll still choose to believe you..\""
        ]
    },
    "49": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"It doesn't matter...Atleast all that crap ended."
        ]
    },
    "51": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\">About catnip...I'm glad you asked."
        ]
    },
    "53": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\">Got you some.\""
        ]
    },
    "56": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Yay! Catnip!\""
        ]
    },
    "60": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Lira:$12345678> \"Kidda disappears an entire day and appears with catnip...?",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Kidda...Where the hell were you?\""
        ]
    },
    "64": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"There she is...She's there at the door.\""
        ]
    },
    "67": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Lira:$12345678> \"Kaida I told to look for her...\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"You gotta stop being so lazy.\""
        ]
    },
    "72": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"It was too comfy inside here.\"",
            "<c$$12345678\"> Also she kicked too many asses today. She's fine.\""
        ]
    },
    "75": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Lira:$12345678> \"And now that I have this catnip...\"",
        ]
    },
    "78": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"You can be high and that means be more lazy now?\""
        ]
    },
    "81": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kaida:$12345678> \"Yes! Now I can lay my fat ass all day without a worry.\""
        ]
    },
    "83": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\">  Oh I feel like seeing fish all over me.\""
        ]
    },
    "86": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$Kidda:$12345678> \"I think you're already lost in it.\""
        ]
    },
    "88": {
        "lines": [
            "<c$$12345678\"> \"I'll stay and rest for now...Has been a long day.\""
        ]
    },
